From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gnoblin contributors <gnoblin@localhost>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] shell: route Gnoblin window effects through animation engine

Use the shared animation engine for Gnoblin window and layer lifecycle effects,
resize feedback, tile previews, and dialog dimming. Register the engine module
as a GNOME Shell resource.

---
